@Tms.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Health probe
GET {{Tms.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### Swagger / OpenAPI document
GET {{Tms.Api_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json

### Sign in (admin) - copy the accessToken into @token below
# @name login
POST {{Tms.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@towerco.demo",
  "password": "TowerCo!2026"
}

###
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Who am I (roles + permissions drive the UI menu)
GET {{Tms.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter sites: country + status + sorting + paging (use case 3)
GET {{Tms.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sites?country=DE&status=Active&sort=utilization&page=1&pageSize=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sites with free tenant slots only
GET {{Tms.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sites?hasCapacity=true&pageSize=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard summary (use case 4)
GET {{Tms.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Lookups for forms/filters
GET {{Tms.Api_HostAddress}}/api/lookups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Register a site with its first tower (use case 1 - Operations/Admin)
POST {{Tms.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "siteCode": "DE-BER-0999",
  "name": "Berlin Demo Site",
  "countryCode": "DE",
  "city": "Berlin",
  "address": "Demo Street 1",
  "latitude": 52.52,
  "longitude": 13.405,
  "siteType": "Greenfield",
  "status": "Active",
  "acquiredOn": "2025-01-15",
  "monthlySiteCost": 480,
  "notes": "Created from the .http file",
  "tower": {
    "towerCode": "DE-BER-0999-T1",
    "structureType": "Lattice",
    "heightMeters": 42,
    "tenantCapacity": 3,
    "antennaMountCapacity": 10
  }
}

### Assign a tenant (use case 2 - Commercial/Admin). A full tower returns 409 tower_capacity_exceeded.
POST {{Tms.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tenancies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "towerId": "paste-tower-id-here",
  "operatorId": "paste-operator-id-here",
  "spaceType": "Antenna",
  "antennaCount": 2,
  "monthlyRent": 1750,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "startDate": "2026-01-01"
}

### Tower capacity verdict
GET {{Tms.Api_HostAddress}}/api/towers/paste-tower-id-here/capacity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Users (Admin only)
GET {{Tms.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reset the demo portfolio (Development environment only)
POST {{Tms.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dev/reset-demo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

